  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Power System Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to increase the number of electricity connections for the urban centers of Charikarcomma Gulbahar and Jabul-es-Seraj and Pul-e-Khumri and to improve the availability of power from Naghlu and Mahipar switchyards.</narrative>
  </description>
